Article 155 (Penalty provisions) A person who has failed to comply with the request of any police official to produce his or her driver's license or to make a statement to identify a driver, in violation of Article 92 (2) shall be punished by a fine not exceeding 200,000 won or by misdemeanor imprisonment.
