  (2) Any of the following persons shall be subject to an administrative fine not exceeding 200,000 won: <Amended on Jan. 28, 2014; Dec. 30, 2014; Oct. 24, 2017; Mar. 27, 2018; May 26, 2020; Jan. 12, 2021; Mar. 19, 2024>
