20375
ADDENDA <Act No. 20375, Mar. 19, 2024>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force six months after the date of its promulgation; provided, Article 56-3 shall enter into force one year after the date of the promulgation.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning matters to be observed by test drivers of autonomous motor vehicles)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 56-3, a person who drives an autonomous motor vehicle for which temporary driving permission has been granted as at the time this Act enters into force but has failed to receive traffic safety education, shall receive traffic safety education within six months after the date of enforcement of the same amended provisions.

